cond_digit = s[1]\n\n    # Check the rest of the digits alternate between the two\n    for i in range(2, len(s)):\n        # If the index is even, it should match the first digit\n        if i % 2 == 0:\n            if s[i] != first_digit:\n                return False\n        # If the index is odd, it should match the second digit\n        else:\n            if s[i] != second_digit:\n                return False\n\n    return True\n</answer>'
