actors(n):\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    total = 0\n    for i in range(1, int(n**0.5) + 1):\n        if n % i == 0:\n            if i % 2 == 1:\n                total += i\n            counterpart = n // i\n            if counterpart != i and counterpart % 2 == 1:\n                total += counterpart\n    return total\n```\n</answer>'
