or code density and performance.\n</think>\n\n<answer>\ndef cube_Sum(n):return 2*n**2*(n+1)**2\n</answer>\n<bash>echo 'def cube_Sum(n):return 2*n**2*(n+1)**2' > experiments/solution.py</bash>"
