ht):\n    """\n    Calculate the area of a trapezium using the formula: (base1 + base2) * height / 2.\n    \n    Parameters:\n    base1 (float): Length of the first base.\n    base2 (float): Length of the second base.\n    height (float): Height of the trapezium.\n    \n    Returns:\n    float: The area of the trapezium.\n    """\n    return (base1 + base2) * height / 2\n```\n</answer>'
