or the loop is:\n\ni starts at 3. while i*i <=n. At this point, n is 3. i is 3. So 3*3=9 <=3 is false. So the loop doesn\'t run. Then check if n>1 (3>1), add 3. Total is 2+3=5. Correct.\n\nAnother test case: n=4. Handled by 2: add 2, then n becomes 1. Then loop over i=3. i*i=9 >1. no loop. n is'
